{"text":{"en":{"강구 | [회사명] 베어링":"Steel Balls | [Company Name] Bearing","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Ball / Retainer / Caster</p> <h2>강구</h2> <p>정밀 강구를 재질별로 취급하며, 금·은·아연·니켈 도금도 가능합니다. (재고·주문 제작 규격 범위는 아래 참고)</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Ball / Retainer / Caster</p> <h2>Steel Balls</h2> <p>We carry precision steel balls by material, and gold, silver, zinc, and nickel plating are also available. (See below for in-stock and made-to-order spec ranges.)</p>","재질 구분":"Material","규격(호칭)":"Spec (Designation)","주요 특징":"Key Features","주요 용도":"Main Applications","규격표(중량 환산표)<span class=\"series-count\">37건</span>":"Spec Table (Weight Conversion Table)<span class=\"series-count\">37 items</span>","<label for=\"bballFilter\">규격(mm) 검색</label> <input id=\"bballFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: 6.35 또는 1/4\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"bballFilter\">Spec (mm) Search</label> <input id=\"bballFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. 6.35 or 1/4\" autocomplete=\"off\">","인치 규격":"Inch Spec","kg/1000개":"kg/1000 pcs","개/1kg":"pcs/1kg","kg/1그로스(144개)":"kg/1 gross (144 pcs)","0.6~80mm까지 재고 보유, 150mm까지 주문 제작 가능. 위 표는 대표 규격의 중량 환산표이며, 0.5~100mm 전체 세부 규격(강구 제원표)은 견적 문의로 안내드립니다.":"We keep stock up to 0.6~80mm, and made-to-order sizes up to 150mm are available. The table above is a weight conversion table for representative sizes; the full detailed spec range of 0.5~100mm (steel ball spec table) is provided upon quote inquiry.","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">형태 참고용 개념도 (SWS 카탈로그 실측 도면 아님) — 강구 지름 표시 위치</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 228\" width=\"280\" height=\"213\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto;\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"100\" r=\"70\" fill=\"#eeeeee\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <ellipse cx=\"125\" cy=\"72\" rx=\"18\" ry=\"11\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"none\"> <g stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 3 2 3\"> <line x1=\"68\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"232\" y2=\"100\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"182\"> </g> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"204\"> <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"204\"> <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"198\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"198\" marker-start=\"url(#sbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#sbArrow)\"> </g> <text x=\"150\" y=\"220\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">d</text> <defs> <marker id=\"sbArrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"3\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d = 강구 지름 — 아래 규격표의 ‘인치 규격’·‘mm’ 열이 이 지름입니다. 개념도이므로 비례는 실제와 다를 수 있습니다.</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">Conceptual diagram for shape reference only (not an SWS catalog measured drawing) — where the ball diameter is measured</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 228\" width=\"280\" height=\"213\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto;\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"100\" r=\"70\" fill=\"#eeeeee\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <ellipse cx=\"125\" cy=\"72\" rx=\"18\" ry=\"11\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"none\"> <g stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 3 2 3\"> <line x1=\"68\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"232\" y2=\"100\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"182\"> </g> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"204\"> <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"204\"> <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"198\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"198\" marker-start=\"url(#sbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#sbArrow)\"> </g> <text x=\"150\" y=\"220\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">d</text> <defs> <marker id=\"sbArrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"3\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d = ball diameter — the ‘Inch size’ and ‘mm’ columns in the table below give this diameter. As this is a conceptual diagram, proportions may differ from the actual product.</p>","규격(mm) 검색":"Spec (mm) Search"},"ja":{"강구 | [회사명] 베어링":"鋼球 | [会社名] ベアリング","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Ball / Retainer / Caster</p> <h2>강구</h2> <p>정밀 강구를 재질별로 취급하며, 금·은·아연·니켈 도금도 가능합니다. (재고·주문 제작 규격 범위는 아래 참고)</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Ball / Retainer / Caster</p> <h2>鋼球</h2> <p>精密鋼球を材質別に取り扱っており、金・銀・亜鉛・ニッケルメッキにも対応可能です。(在庫・受注生産の規格範囲は下記をご参照ください)</p>","재질 구분":"材質区分","규격(호칭)":"規格(呼称)","주요 특징":"主な特徴","주요 용도":"主な用途","규격표(중량 환산표)<span class=\"series-count\">37건</span>":"規格表(重量換算表)<span class=\"series-count\">37件</span>","<label for=\"bballFilter\">규격(mm) 검색</label> <input id=\"bballFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: 6.35 또는 1/4\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"bballFilter\">規格(mm)検索</label> <input id=\"bballFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"例: 6.35 または 1/4\" autocomplete=\"off\">","인치 규격":"インチ規格","kg/1000개":"kg/1000個","개/1kg":"個/1kg","kg/1그로스(144개)":"kg/1グロス(144個)","0.6~80mm까지 재고 보유, 150mm까지 주문 제작 가능. 위 표는 대표 규격의 중량 환산표이며, 0.5~100mm 전체 세부 규격(강구 제원표)은 견적 문의로 안내드립니다.":"0.6~80mmまで在庫を保有し、150mmまで受注生産が可能です。上記の表は代表規格の重量換算表であり、0.5~100mmの全詳細規格(鋼球諸元表)はお見積り依頼でご案内します。","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">형태 참고용 개념도 (SWS 카탈로그 실측 도면 아님) — 강구 지름 표시 위치</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 228\" width=\"280\" height=\"213\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto;\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"100\" r=\"70\" fill=\"#eeeeee\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <ellipse cx=\"125\" cy=\"72\" rx=\"18\" ry=\"11\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"none\"> <g stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 3 2 3\"> <line x1=\"68\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"232\" y2=\"100\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"182\"> </g> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"204\"> <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"204\"> <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"198\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"198\" marker-start=\"url(#sbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#sbArrow)\"> </g> <text x=\"150\" y=\"220\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">d</text> <defs> <marker id=\"sbArrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"3\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d = 강구 지름 — 아래 규격표의 ‘인치 규격’·‘mm’ 열이 이 지름입니다. 개념도이므로 비례는 실제와 다를 수 있습니다.</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">形状参考用の概念図（SWSカタログ実測図面ではありません） — 鋼球径の表示位置</p> <svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 228\" width=\"280\" height=\"213\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto;\" fill=\"none\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"100\" r=\"70\" fill=\"#eeeeee\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <ellipse cx=\"125\" cy=\"72\" rx=\"18\" ry=\"11\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"none\"> <g stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 3 2 3\"> <line x1=\"68\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"232\" y2=\"100\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"182\"> </g> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"204\"> <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"204\"> <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"198\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"198\" marker-start=\"url(#sbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#sbArrow)\"> </g> <text x=\"150\" y=\"220\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">d</text> <defs> <marker id=\"sbArrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"3\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d = 鋼球径 — 下の規格表の「インチ規格」・「mm」列がこの径です。概念図のため、比率は実際と異なる場合があります。</p>","규격(mm) 검색":"規格(mm)検索"},"zh":{"강구 | [회사명] 베어링":"钢球 | [公司名] 轴承","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Ball / Retainer / Caster</p> <h2>강구</h2> <p>정밀 강구를 재질별로 취급하며, 금·은·아연·니켈 도금도 가능합니다. (재고·주문 제작 규격 범위는 아래 참고)</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Ball / Retainer / Caster</p> <h2>钢球</h2> <p>按材质经销精密钢球，并可提供镀金、镀银、镀锌、镀镍服务。(库存·定制生产规格范围请参见下方)</p>","재질 구분":"材质分类","규격(호칭)":"规格(型号)","주요 특징":"主要特点","주요 용도":"主要用途","규격표(중량 환산표)<span class=\"series-count\">37건</span>":"规格表(