"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"> <circle cx=\"150\" cy=\"100\" r=\"70\" fill=\"#eeeeee\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"> <ellipse cx=\"125\" cy=\"72\" rx=\"18\" ry=\"11\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke=\"none\"> <g stroke=\"#999\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"8 3 2 3\"> <line x1=\"68\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"232\" y2=\"100\"> <line x1=\"150\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"150\" y2=\"182\"> </g> <g stroke=\"#666\" stroke-width=\"1\"> <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"204\"> <line x1=\"220\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"204\"> <line x1=\"80\" y1=\"198\" x2=\"220\" y2=\"198\" marker-start=\"url(#sbArrow)\" marker-end=\"url(#sbArrow)\"> </g> <text x=\"150\" y=\"220\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#333\" font-weight=\"600\">d</text> <defs> <marker id=\"sbArrow\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" refX=\"3\" refY=\"3\" orient=\"auto\"> <path d=\"M0,0 L6,3 L0,6 Z\" fill=\"#666\"> </marker> </defs> </svg> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d = 钢球直径 — 下方规格表中“英制规格”・“mm”列即为此直径。由于是示意图，比例可能与实物不同。</p>","규격(mm) 검색":"规格(mm)搜索"}},"attrs":{"en":{"예: 6.35 또는 1/4":"e.g. 6.35 or 1/4"},"ja":{"예: 6.35 또는 1/4":"例: 6.35 または 1/4"},"zh":{"예: 6.35 또는 1/4":"例: 6.35 或 1/4"}}}